Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] subprojects: gmobile v0.6.0_beta1

The wrap in the tag names gmobile v0.4.0, the oldest version phosh-mobile-settings accepts.
This build uses what phoc and phosh are built against, gmobile v0.6.0_beta1 (the same commit
as recipes/cross/phosh/0001), static, as a meson subproject: Termux has no gmobile.

diff --git a/subprojects/gmobile.wrap b/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
index e8f6c55..d5fe74b 100644
--- a/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
+++ b/subprojects/gmobile.wrap
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 [wrap-git]
 directory=gmobile
 url=https://gitlab.gnome.org/World/Phosh/gmobile.git
-revision=v0.4.0
+revision=v0.6.0_beta1
 depth=1
